DERIVED DATA  —  everything under split/ , predictions/ , figures/
================================================================================

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt these files for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit to this work.

These files are derived from publicly available data and must be attributed to
their original sources as well:

  sci-Plex 3 single-cell chemical transcriptomics
    Srivatsan et al., Science 367:45-51 (2020)
    GEO accession GSE139944

  MSigDB Hallmark gene sets
    Liberzon et al., Cell Systems 1:417-425 (2015)

Neither source dataset is redistributed here in full. `split/` contains count
matrices restricted to the nine held-out compounds of the frozen test split;
`predictions/` contains model outputs and the pseudobulk targets they are scored
against.
